hvi Exchange brand name in India. The company offers buying and selling of foreign currency notes and coins, travelers cheques, travel currency cards, co-branded cards, foreign currency demand drafts, and swift/telegraphic transfer; travel insurance; forex for leisure, students forex solutions, corporate FX, travel agents/tour service providers, NRI/NRES, and other services; and remittance facilities. It also provides Western Union money transfer, Money Gram, and Xpress Money. It serves corporates from the IT, manufacturing, and service industries; leisure and business travelers; students; banks; and travel agencies. The company was formerly known as Prithvi Softech Limited and changed its name to Prithvi Exchange (India) Limited in December 2016. Prithvi Exchange (India) Limited was founded in 1992 and is headquartered in Chennai, India."}}